      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "QUESTION: I still don't -- I don't -- I don't see where Justice Breyer's question fits with -- with the issue, does the statute dictate BACT on an individual generator? Never mind the rest."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Thomas G. Hungar (Respondents)",
